{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"thinking_end","contentIndex":0,"content":"All 29 files are .md. Good. I'll still filter .md for safety.\n\nNow let me write the test script.\n\nLet me carefully draft it.\n\n```python\n#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"task11 测试脚本：验证「自然语言 subagent 触发词 → pi 显式触发语法」迁移的验收条件。\n\n用法：\n  python3 task11.py                  # 运行完整验收测试，stdout 输出单行 JSON\n  python3 task11.py --dump-baseline  # （迁移前）以同一正则捕获自然语言触发词基线并落盘\n\n自然语言 subagent 触发词正则（验收与基线共用同一正则，依据 RFC §2.1 / research-report-N1.md F1）：\n  派发 subagent / SPAWN Sub Agent / SPAWN Step / 子 Agent / 父 Agent /\n  Main Agent / Sub Agent / 每个 subagent 独立启动\n基线文件：.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/trigger-baseline.txt（迁移前执行 --dump-baseline 落盘）\n\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport os\nimport re\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# 路径\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSCRIPT = os.path.abspath(__file__)\n# tests -> doing -> job_35 -> .rick -> rick（仓库根）\nPROJECT_ROOT = os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(SCRIPT)))))\nTEMPLATES_DIR = os.path.join(PROJECT_ROOT, 'internal', 'prompt', 'templates')\nBASELINE_FILE = os.path.join(PROJECT_ROOT, '.rick', 'jobs', 'job_35', 'doing', 'trigger-baseline.txt')\nSENSE_LOOP = os.path.join(TEMPLATES_DIR, 'sense_loop.md')\nRICK_BIN = os.path.join(PROJECT_ROOT, 'bin', 'rick')\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# 验收正则（与 baseline 捕获共用）\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTRIGGER_RE = re.compile(\n    r'派发\\s*subagent'\n    r'|SPAWN\\s+Sub\\s+Agent'\n    r'|SPAWN\\s+Step'\n    r'|子\\s*Agent'\n    r'|父\\s*Agent'\n    r'|Main\\s+Agent'\n    r'|Sub\\s+Agent'\n    r'|每个\\s+subagent\\s+独立启动',\n    re.IGNORECASE,\n)\nPI_SYNTAX_RE = re.compile(r'workflowScript|runs\\.run|runs\\.all')\nAGENT_NAME_RE = re.compile(r\"agent:'worker'|agent:'reviewer'|agent:'think'|agent:'research'|agent:'exporter'\")\nSENSE_RE = re.compile(r'批判门禁|反向回流|judgment\\.md')\n```\n\nWait, `runs\\.run` — in the test method the regex is `runs\\.run`. I'll write `runs\\.run` and `runs\\.all` to match literally.\n\nHelper functions:\n\n```python\ndef md_files():\n    for dirpath, _dirs, files in os.walk(TEMPLATES_DIR):\n        for fn in sorted(files):\n            if fn.endswith('.md'):\n                yield os.path.join(dirpath, fn)\n\n\ndef total_matches(regex):\n    total = 0\n    for path in md_files():\n        with open(path, encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            total += len(regex.findall(f.read()))\n    return total\n\n\ndef files_with_match(regex):\n    count = 0\n    for path in md_files():\n        with open(path, encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            if regex.search(f.read()):\n                count += 1\n    return count\n\n\ndef read_baseline():\n    if not os.path.exists(BASELINE_FILE):\n        return None\n    with open(BASELINE_FILE, encoding='utf-8') as f:\n        text = f.read().strip()\n    m = re.search(r'\\d+', text)\n    if m is None:\n        return None\n    return int(m.group())\n\n\ndef run(cmd, timeout=300):\n    try:\n        p = subprocess.run(cmd, cwd=PROJECT_ROOT, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=timeout)\n        return p.returncode, p.stdout, p.stderr\n    except Exception as e:\n        return -1, '', str(e)\n```\n\nNow main():\n\n```python\ndef main():\n    # --dump-baseline：迁移前捕获基线（与验收同一正则）\n    if '--dump-baseline' in sys.argv[1:]:\n        count = total_matches(TRIGGER_RE)\n        os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(BASELINE_FILE), exist_ok=True)\n        with open(BASELINE_FILE, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            f.write(str(count) + '\\n')\n        print(count)\n        sys.exit(0)\n\n    errors = []\n\n    # 前置检查：templates 目录存在\n    if not os.path.isdir(TEMPLATES_DIR):\n        errors.append(f'templates 目录不存在: {TEMPLATES_DIR}')\n        print(json.dumps({'pass': False, 'errors': errors}))\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    # ---- Test 1 正常路径 ----\n    # 1a. 基线文件存在\n    baseline = read_baseline()\n    if baseline is None:\n        errors.append('trigger-baseline.txt 不存在或格式非法：迁移前必须先执行 '\n                      '`python3 task11.py --dump-baseline` 捕获自然语言触发词基线')\n    # 1b. pi 触发语法 ≥ 1 个模板文件（迁移前为 0）\n    pi_files = files_with_match(PI_SYNTAX_RE)\n    if pi_files < 1:\n        errors.append(f'pi 触发语法(workflowScript/runs.run/runs.all)命中文件数 {pi_files} < 1，迁移未落地')\n    # 1c. 迁移后自然语言触发词计数 < 基线\n    current = total_matches(TRIGGER_RE)\n    if baseline is not None:\n        if current >= baseline:\n            errors.append(f'自然语言触发词计数未下降：当前 {current} >= 基线 {baseline}')\n    # else: 基线缺失已报错\n\n    # ---- Test 2 边界：真实 agent 名 ----\n    agent_files = files_with_match(AGENT_NAME_RE)\n    if agent_files < 1:\n        errors.append(f'真实 agent 名(agent:\\'worker\\'/.../exporter)命中文件数 {agent_files} < 1')\n\n    # ---- Test 3 异常：SENSE 语义 + 无变量泄漏 + go 全绿 ----\n    # 3a. sense_loop.md 语义保留\n    sense_hits = 0\n    if os.path.exists(SENSE_LOOP):\n        with open(SENSE_LOOP, encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            sense_hits = len(SENSE_RE.findall(f.read()))\n    else:\n        errors.append(f'sense_loop.md 不存在: {SENSE_LOOP}')\n    if os.path.exists(SENSE_LOOP) and sense_hits < 1:\n        errors.append(f'sense_loop.md 批判门禁/反向回流/judgment.md 语义命中 {sense_hits} < 1')\n\n    # 3b. go build\n    rc, out, err = run(['go', 'build', './...'])\n    if rc != 0:\n        errors.append('go build ./... 失败: ' + (err or out)[:500])\n\n    # 3c. plan --dry-run 无 {{ 泄漏\n    if os.path.exists(RICK_BIN):\n        rc, out, err = run([RICK_BIN, 'plan', '--dry-run'], timeout=120)\n        if rc != 0:\n            errors.append('rick plan --dry-run 失败: ' + (err or out)[:500])\n        else:\n            brace = out.count('{{')\n            if brace != 0:\n                errors.append(f'rick plan --dry-run 存在未替换变量泄漏 {brace} 处 \"{{{{\"')\n    else:\n        errors.append(f'rick 二进制不存在: {RICK_BIN}')\n\n    # 3d. go test ./internal/prompt/... -v 全绿\n    rc, out, err = run(['go', 'test', './internal/prompt/...', '-v'], timeout=600)\n    if rc != 0:\n        tail = (err or out)[-800:]\n        errors.append('go test ./internal/prompt/... -v 未全绿: ' + tail)\n\n    result = {'pass': len(errors) == 0, 'errors': errors}\n    print(json.dumps(result))\n    sys.exit(0 if result['pass'] else 1)\n```\n\nWait, there's a subtle bug in the brace error message: I wrote `{brace} 处 \"{{{{\"`. The `{{{{` in an f-string — f-string interprets `{{` as literal `{`. So `\"{{{{\"` → `\"{{\"`. Good, that prints `\"{{\"`. Actually let me just write it clearly without confusion: `f'rick plan --dry-run 输出含 {brace} 处未替换的 \"{{\"'`. In f-string, `{{` → `{`. So it prints `\"{{\"`. Good. But to avoid confusion, I'll write a clearer message: `f'rick plan --dry-run 输出泄漏 {brace} 处未替换变量（{{）'`. Hmm, `{{` in f-string renders as `{`. So it'd render `（{）`. Let me just avoid the brace literal issue: use a normal string concatenation or simpler message: `'rick plan --dry-run 输出含未替换的 {{{{ 变量 {brace} 处'`. Actually simplest: `f\"rick plan --dry-run 输出含 {brace} 处未替换变量'{{'\"`. This is getting confusing. I'll write: `'rick plan --dry-run 输出含未替换变量 \"{{\" 共 ' + str(brace) + ' 处'`. Use string concatenation to avoid f-string brace escaping entirely.\n\nLet me clean that up.\n\nAlso, the run() function captures output with text=True. On Python 3.7+, fine.\n\nNow, about the `errors` message for baseline: I should also mention the current count vs baseline for debuggability. I'll include current count in the message when baseline exists.\n\nLet me refine the messages to be informative but concise.\n\nAlso: for the pi_files check and agent_files check, I'll include the actual count.\n\nNow, another consideration: the `read_baseline` extracts first `\\d+`. If the baseline file contains \"109\\n\", int works. Good.\n\nLet me also consider: what if the implementer writes the baseline file with a note like \"基线=109\"? My regex `\\d+` extracts 109. Good.\n\nNow, let me also double check the exit code and JSON: `print(json.dumps(result))` then `sys.exit(0/1)`. Ensure nothing else prints to stdout. The run() captures output (doesn't print). Good.\n\nOne more thing: subprocess with `text=True` and `capture_output=True` — for go test with `-v`, stdout could be large. That's fine.\n\nNow, potential issue: `os.walk(TEMPLATES_DIR)` — if TEMPLATES_DIR missing, os.walk returns nothing (no error). I handle the missing dir with a pre-check.\n\nLet me also think: the test method's pi syntax check counts FILES (`grep -v ':0' | wc -l`). My `files_with_match` counts files. Good. Same for agent names. For SENSE semantic check, the test method uses `grep -cE '...' sense_loop.md` which counts LINES (grep -c counts matching lines, not occurrences). Expected ≥1. My `len(SENSE_RE.findall(...))` counts OCCURRENCES, which is ≥ lines. Since expected is ≥1 and there are 16 lines/occurrences, either works. But to be faithful, I could count matching lines. Actually `grep -c` counts matching LINES. But ≥1 is trivially satisfied either way. I'll count occurrences (findall) — it's fine and arguably stricter. Actually, to be faithful to the test method, let me count matching lines for the sense check. Hmm, but it doesn't matter for the ≥1 threshold. I'll keep findall (occurrences) — simpler and the threshold is the same.\n\nWait, actually there's a subtlety: `grep -cE '批判门禁|反向回流|judgment.md' sense_loop.md` returns count of lines matching. If a line has multiple matches, grep -c still counts it once. My findall counts each occurrence. Both ≥1. Fine.\n\nNow let me also reconsider the trigger count semantics. The test method doesn't give the exact command for the trigger count; it says \"以验收同一正则捕获自然语言触发词基线计数\". So I define it as total occurrences. Fine.\n\nLet me also add to the script a clear header comment documenting the regex and the exact grep equivalence so the implementer can cross-check.\n\nNow, let me also verify: should I include `SPAWN\\s+Step` in the pattern? \"SPAWN Step 1 子 Agent\" — the \"SPAWN Step\" is a trigger phrase. But note \"SPAWN Step 1 子 Agent\" ALSO contains \"子 Agent\" (the \"子 Agent\" at the end). With finditer (non-overlapping), \"SPAWN Step\" matches first (position 0-10), then continues after \"Step\"... wait \"SPAWN Step 1 子 Agent\": \n- \"SPAWN\\s+Step\" matches \"SPAWN Step\" (indices 0..9).\n- Then scanning continues from index 10: \" 1 子 Agent\". \"子 Agent\" would match at the \"子 Agent\" position. So both \"SPAWN Step\" AND \"子 Agent\" get counted for the same line.\n\nIn learning_loop, \"SPAWN Step 1 子 Agent\" → \"SPAWN Step\" (1) + \"子 Agent\" (1) = 2 matches per line, 7 such lines → 7 SPAWN Step + 7 子 Agent. That's consistent with my earlier Counter: SPAWN Step 7, 子 Agent 28 (includes the 7 from SPAWN lines + others).\n\nIs this double-counting a problem? It's consistent between baseline and post-migration as long as I use the same regex. After migration, \"SPAWN Step 1 子 Agent\" becomes `runs.run('step1', {agent:'worker', ...})` — both \"SPAWN Step\" and \"子 Agent\" disappear. So the count decreases correctly. Fine.\n\nNow, let me finalize and write the file.\n\nActually, let me reconsider one more time whether to include \"Sub\\s+Agent\" as standalone. In doing_loop/gen-loop, the text has \"Sub Agent\" standalone (in \"Main Agent\" / \"Sub Agent\" headings). My pattern: \"Main\\s+Agent\" (21) + \"Sub\\s+Agent\" (24) + \"SPAWN Sub Agent\" (2). The \"SPAWN Sub Agent\" is a subset; with alternation order \"SPAWN\\s+Sub\\s+Agent\" first, it matches fully. Good. Total = 109 as computed.\n\nNow write it.\n\nLet me also think about whether `re.IGNORECASE` on `Sub\\s+Agent` could match something like \"SUB AGENT\"? Yes, but that's fine (still a natural trigger term). And \"main agent\" lowercase (3 occurrences) — the IGNORECASE makes \"Main\\s+Agent\" match \"main agent\". Good, those 3 are counted (in sense_loop/research \"main age