e.\n\nLet me also add to the script a clear header comment documenting the regex and the exact grep equivalence so the implementer can cross-check.\n\nNow, let me also verify: should I include `SPAWN\\s+Step` in the pattern? \"SPAWN Step 1 子 Agent\" — the \"SPAWN Step\" is a trigger phrase. But note \"SPAWN Step 1 子 Agent\" ALSO contains \"子 Agent\" (the \"子 Agent\" at the end). With finditer (non-overlapping), \"SPAWN Step\" matches first (position 0-10), then continues after \"Step\"... wait \"SPAWN Step 1 子 Agent\": \n- \"SPAWN\\s+Step\" matches \"SPAWN Step\" (indices 0..9).\n- Then scanning continues from index 10: \" 1 子 Agent\". \"子 Agent\" would match at the \"子 Agent\" position. So both \"SPAWN Step\" AND \"子 Agent\" get counted for the same line.\n\nIn learning_loop, \"SPAWN Step 1 子 Agent\" → \"SPAWN Step\" (1) + \"子 Agent\" (1) = 2 matches per line, 7 such lines → 7 SPAWN Step + 7 子 Agent. That's consistent with my earlier Counter: SPAWN Step 7, 子 Agent 28 (includes the 7 from SPAWN lines + others).\n\nIs this double-counting a problem? It's consistent between baseline and post-migration as long as I use the same regex. After migration, \"SPAWN Step 1 子 Agent\" becomes `runs.run('step1', {agent:'worker', ...})` — both \"SPAWN Step\" and \"子 Agent\" disappear. So the count decreases correctly. Fine.\n\nNow, let me finalize and write the file.\n\nActually, let me reconsider one more time whether to include \"Sub\\s+Agent\" as standalone. In doing_loop/gen-loop, the text has \"Sub Agent\" standalone (in \"Main Agent\" / \"Sub Agent\" headings). My pattern: \"Main\\s+Agent\" (21) + \"Sub\\s+Agent\" (24) + \"SPAWN Sub Agent\" (2). The \"SPAWN Sub Agent\" is a subset; with alternation order \"SPAWN\\s+Sub\\s+Agent\" first, it matches fully. Good. Total = 109 as computed.\n\nNow write it.\n\nLet me also think about whether `re.IGNORECASE` on `Sub\\s+Agent` could match something like \"SUB AGENT\"? Yes, but that's fine (still a natural trigger term). And \"main agent\" lowercase (3 occurrences) — the IGNORECASE makes \"Main\\s+Agent\" match \"main agent\". Good, those 3 are counted (in sense_loop/research \"main agent\" lowercase). After migration, \"main agent\" → \"parent orchestrator\"/\"main agent\" might remain? Actually sense_loop line 16 \"你（main agent）= sense 复核层\" — this \"main agent\" is descriptive and might be kept or changed to \"main agent\" or \"parent\". Hmm. It's only 3 occurrences. Even if kept, the overall count decreases.\n\nOK, writing now.\n\nActually, let me reconsider the PROJECT_ROOT computation once more and verify with a quick calculation after writing, by running the script.\n\nLet me write the file now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"I now understand the codebase and the acceptance criteria. Let me verify a few more details before writing the test script."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_mDnzrp7JIICyXejtZjkV1344","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick && echo \"=== current pi syntax files ===\" && grep -rcE 'workflowScript|runs\\.run|runs\\.all' internal/prompt/templates/ | grep -v ':0' | wc -l && echo \"=== current agent name files ===\" && grep -rcE \"agent:'worker'|agent:'reviewer'|agent:'think'|agent:'research'|agent:'exporter'\" internal/prompt/templates/ | grep -v ':0' | wc -l && echo \"=== sense_loop exists ===\" && test -f internal/prompt/templates/sense_loop.md && echo yes && echo \"=== baseline file exists? ===\" && test -f .rick/jobs/job_35/doing/trigger-baseline.txt && echo yes || echo no"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":153,"output":3890,"cacheRead":56832,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":3638,"totalTokens":60875,"cost":{"input":0.000066555,"output":0.0033843000000000002,"cacheRead":0.000206016,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.003656871}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786914727170,"responseId":"df546401-4d22-4f53-881f-f5068297121f","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_mDnzrp7JIICyXejtZjkV1344","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"=== current pi syntax files ===\n0\n=== current agent name files ===\n0\n=== sense_loop exists ===\nyes\n=== baseline file exists? ===\nno\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786914764014},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Confirmed current state:\n- pi syntax files: 0\n- agent name files: 0\n- sense_loop exists\n- baseline file: no\n\nSo the migration is NOT done. The test script should currently output `pass: false` with errors. Let me write the test script now.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll write the test script."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_TR9gVWjnDEMChW84rVwQ8692","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workdir/sunquan20/AI_CODING/rick/.rick/jobs/job_35/doing/tests/task11.py","content":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"task11 测试脚本：验证「自然语言 subagent 触发词 → pi 显式触发语法」迁移的验收条件。\n\n用法：\n  python3 task11.py                  # 运行完整验收测试，stdout 输出恰好一行 JSON\n  python3 task11.py --dump-baseline  # （迁移前）以同一正则捕获自然语言触发词基线并落盘\n\n验收正则（基线捕获与验收共用同一正则，依据 RFC §2.1 / research-report-N1.md F1\n所列自然语言 subagent 触发术语）：\n  派发 subagent / SPAWN Sub Agent / SPAWN Step / 子 Agent / 父 Agent /\n  Main Agent / Sub Agent / 每个 subagent 独立启动\n\n等价 grep 对照（迁移前先落盘基线，迁移后据此断言计数下降）：\n  grep -roiE '派发\\s*subagent|SPAWN\\s+Sub\\s+Agent|SPAWN\\s+Step|子\\s*Agent|父\\s*Agent|Main\\s+Agent|Sub\\s+Agent|每个\\s+subagent\\s+独立启动' internal/prompt/templates/ | wc -l\n\"\"\"\nimport json\nimport os\nimport re\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# 路径（绝对路径）\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSCRIPT = os.path.abspath(__file__)\n# tests -> doing -> job_35 -> .rick -> rick（仓库根）\nPROJECT_ROOT = os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(os.path.dirname(SCRIPT)))))\nTEMPLATES_DIR = os.path.join(PROJECT_ROOT, 'internal', 'prompt', 'templates')\nBASELINE_FILE = os.path.join(PROJECT_ROOT, '.rick', 'jobs', 'job_35', 'doing', 'trigger-baseline.txt')\nSENSE_LOOP = os.path.join(TEMPLATES_DIR, 'sense_loop.md')\nRICK_BIN = os.path.join(PROJECT_ROOT, 'bin', 'rick')\n\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\n# 验收正则\n# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nTRIGGER_RE = re.compile(\n    r'派发\\s*subagent'\n    r'|SPAWN\\s+Sub\\s+Agent'\n    r'|SPAWN\\s+Step'\n    r'|子\\s*Agent'\n    r'|父\\s*Agent'\n    r'|Main\\s+Agent'\n    r'|Sub\\s+Agent'\n    r'|每个\\s+subagent\\s+独立启动',\n    re.IGNORECASE,\n)\nPI_SYNTAX_RE = re.compile(r'workflowScript|runs\\.run|runs\\.all')\nAGENT_NAME_RE = re.compile(r\"agent:'worker'|agent:'reviewer'|agent:'think'|agent:'research'|agent:'exporter'\")\nSENSE_RE = re.compile(r'批判门禁|反向回流|judgment\\.md')\n\n\ndef md_files():\n    \"\"\"递归产出 templates 目录下所有 .md 文件路径。\"\"\"\n    for dirpath, _dirs, files in os.walk(TEMPLATES_DIR):\n        for fn in sorted(files):\n            if fn.endswith('.md'):\n                yield os.path.join(dirpath, fn)\n\n\ndef total_matches(regex):\n    \"\"\"统计所有模板文件中正则的匹配总次数（non-overlapping）。\"\"\"\n    total = 0\n    for path in md_files():\n        try:\n            with open(path, encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                total += len(regex.findall(f.read()))\n        except Exception:\n            continue\n    return total\n\n\ndef files_with_match(regex):\n    \"\"\"统计至少命中一次正则的模板文件数（等价 grep -c | grep -v ':0' | wc -l）。\"\"\"\n    count = 0\n    for path in md_files():\n        try:\n            with open(path, encoding='utf-8') as f:\n                if regex.search(f.read()):\n                    count += 1\n        except Exception:\n            continue\n    return count\n\n\ndef read_baseline():\n    \"\"\"读取基线文件中的自然语言触发词计数（迁移前由 --dump-baseline 落盘）。\"\"\"\n    if not os.path.exists(BASELINE_FILE):\n        return None\n    try:\n        with open(BASELINE_FILE, encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            text = f.read().strip()\n        m = re.search(r'\\d+', text)\n        return int(m.group()) if m else None\n    except Exception:\n        return None\n\n\ndef run(cmd, timeout=300):\n    \"\"\"在项目根目录执行命令，返回 (returncode, stdout, stderr)。\"\"\"\n    try:\n        p = subprocess.run(cmd, cwd=PROJECT_ROOT, capture_output=True, text=True, timeout=timeout)\n        return p.returncode, p.stdout, p.stderr\n    except Exception as e:\n        return -1, '', str(e)\n\n\ndef main():\n    # 迁移前捕获基线（与验收共用同一正则，保证前后口径一致）\n    if '--dump-baseline' in sys.argv[1:]:\n        count = total_matches(TRIGGER_RE)\n        os.makedirs(os.path.dirname(BASELINE_FILE), exist_ok=True)\n        with open(BASELINE_FILE, 'w', encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            f.write(str(count) + '\\n')\n        print(count)\n        sys.exit(0)\n\n    errors = []\n\n    # 前置检查：templates 目录必须存在\n    if not os.path.isdir(TEMPLATES_DIR):\n        errors.append('templates 目录不存在: ' + TEMPLATES_DIR)\n        print(json.dumps({'pass': False, 'errors': errors}))\n        sys.exit(1)\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # Test 1 正常路径：迁移落地 + 自然语言触发词计数下降\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    baseline = read_baseline()\n    if baseline is None:\n        errors.append(\n            'trigger-baseline.txt 不存在或格式非法；迁移前必须先执行 '\n            '`python3 task11.py --dump-baseline` 捕获自然语言触发词基线'\n        )\n\n    pi_files = files_with_match(PI_SYNTAX_RE)\n    if pi_files < 1:\n        errors.append(\n            'pi 触发语法(workflowScript/runs.run/runs.all)命中文件数 %d < 1，迁移未落地' % pi_files\n        )\n\n    current = total_matches(TRIGGER_RE)\n    if baseline is not None and current >= baseline:\n        errors.append(\n            '自然语言触发词计数未下降：当前 %d >= 基线 %d' % (current, baseline)\n        )\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # Test 2 边界：真实内置/自定义 agent 名被显式引用\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    agent_files = files_with_match(AGENT_NAME_RE)\n    if agent_files < 1:\n        errors.append(\n            \"真实 agent 名(agent:'worker'/'reviewer'/'think'/'research'/'exporter')命中文件数 %d < 1\" % agent_files\n        )\n\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    # Test 3 异常：SENSE 特有语义不丢 + 无变量泄漏 + go 全绿\n    # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n    sense_hits = 0\n    if os.path.exists(SENSE_LOOP):\n        with open(SENSE_LOOP, encoding='utf-8') as f:\n            sense_hits = len(SENSE_RE.findall(f.read()))\n        if sense_hits < 1:\n            errors.append('sense_loop.md 批判门禁/反向回流/judgment.md 语义命中 %d < 1' % sense_hits)\n    else:\n        errors.append('sense_loop.md 不存在: ' + SENSE_LOOP)\n\n    # go build\n    rc, out, err = run(['go', 'build', './...'])\n    if rc != 0:\n        errors.append('go build ./... 失败: ' + (err or out)[:500])\n\n    # plan --dry-run 无 {{ 泄漏（PromptBuilder 未替换变量会泄漏 \"{{\"）\n    if os.path.exists(RICK_BIN):\n        rc, out, err = run([RICK_BIN, 'plan', '--dry-run'], timeout=120)\n        if rc != 0:\n            errors.append('rick plan --dry-run 失败: ' + (err or out)[:500])\n        else:\n            brace = out.count('{{')\n            if brace != 0:\n                errors.append('rick plan --dry-run 输出含未替换变量 \"{{\" 共 ' + str(brace) + ' 处')\n    else:\n        errors.append('rick 二进制不存在: ' + RICK_BIN)\n\n    # go test ./internal/prompt/... -v 全绿\n    rc, out, err = run(['go', 'test', './internal/prompt/...', '-v'], timeout=600)\n    if rc != 0:\n        errors.append('go test ./internal/prompt/... -v 未全绿: ' + (err or out)[-800:])\n\n    result = {'pass': len(errors) == 0, 'errors': errors}\n    print(json.dumps(result))\n    sys.exit(0 if result['pass'] else 1)\n\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":